Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:51:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: swap CTransaction and BlockMerkleRoot to V2 v7 wire
 format

Swaps CTransaction, CMutableTransaction, CTxIn, CTxOut, coins, tx_check,
tx_verify, and BlockMerkleRoot to V2 v7 transactions, dual TxId/TxHash,
and V2 TransactionRoot commitments.
